────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NOTICE — clinical decision support, not medical advice
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

PsychSwitch is decision-support reference material for qualified
clinicians. It is not medical advice. The treating clinician's
judgement, informed by the individual patient's history and local
context, always takes precedence.

The maintainers make no warranty, express or implied, regarding the
completeness or correctness of the clinical content. Always
cross-check against the primary source (Maudsley, BAP, NICE, FDA PI,
local CPG) before acting on any plan generated by this software.
